WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.377
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:07.299
M's begins anew with Honoka and her friends
being in charge of the student council.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:11.136
News of another Love Live
being held comes bursting in.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.971
There's another one!

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.180
That's amazing!

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.765
Maybe we shouldn't enter.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:16.850
What!?

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.436
Honoka was hesitant about participating.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:23.064
However, when she learned that it would
be the third years' last event, she lit up.

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:24.441
Okay!

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.900
Let's be number one!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.071
And so, J's began running
toward winning Love Live again!

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.781
What!?

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:33.241
What do you mean!?

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.034
It's an emergency!

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:39.247
We have to debut a brand-new
song at Love Live.

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:41.333
Brand-new...?

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:45.170
Which means we can't use
any of our previous songs?

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.504
Why this all of a sudden?

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:48.965
More groups have signed up
to participate than anticipated.

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:54.095
And some groups were just planning to
perform cover songs of professional idols.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.890
They're trying to eliminate those groups now.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.308
No way.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:03.104
If we don't do something within the month,
we won't be able to go to Love Live.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:07.859
I guess we have no choice...
I thought this might happen,

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:12.530
so we'll put the song I wrote,
"Nico-Ni-Nico-chan," to some music, and—

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.240
What are we actually going to do?

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:14.949
Ignored!?

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.242
We have to do something!

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.870
What should we do?

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.205
We'll have to write one.

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:22.791
But how?

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:23.625
Maki!

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.003
You mean...

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:28.296
That's right.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.051
Training camp!

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:39.265
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:46.856
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:59.244
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:04.791
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:09.879
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:15.009
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:20.515
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:26.354
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:29.232
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:34.821
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:39.617
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:39.617 --> 00:02:45.749
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:45.749 --> 00:02:50.795
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:50.795 --> 00:02:56.134
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:56.134 --> 00:03:02.849
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:09.314
#2 - Aiming for Victory

00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:14.110
It's beautiful.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.404
The air is so fresh.

00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:18.865
You really are amazing, Maki-chan.

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:21.743
I can't believe you have
a cottage out here, too.

00:03:21.743 --> 00:03:24.496
You're good at singing, too. You're perfect.

00:03:24.496 --> 00:03:26.498
O-Of course.

00:03:26.498 --> 00:03:28.541
Who do you think I am?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.960
What are you bragging about?

00:03:31.336 --> 00:03:33.588
I-I'm not bragging.

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:37.467
You asked to come, so I had to invite you.

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:38.593
Now, now.

00:03:39.093 --> 00:03:40.804
Let's get to the cottage.

00:03:41.638 --> 00:03:44.307
We're really up against the
clock this time around.

00:03:47.519 --> 00:03:48.728
Exactly.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.648
Umi-chan, what's with your bag?

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:52.649
What do you mean?

00:03:52.649 --> 00:03:54.192
Don't you think you over-packed?

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:55.235
We're in the mountains.

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:58.488
If anything, aren't you all too lightly dressed?

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.741
Come on, let's go.

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.535
The mountains are calling!

00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:08.331
Is Umi a mountain climbing maniac?

00:04:08.331 --> 00:04:11.709
I just hope she doesn't go crazy
like she did over the summer...

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:12.961
Swimming Running

00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:18.216
Come on. If we don't hurry, the bus will leave.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:22.554
Huh?

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:26.474
Is something wrong?

00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:30.645
I feel like we're missing something.

00:04:30.645 --> 00:04:32.021
Did you forget something?

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.024
I didn't forget anything.

00:04:35.692 --> 00:04:37.819
I just feel like something's missing.

00:04:44.158 --> 00:04:45.076
You're slacking off too much!

00:04:45.827 --> 00:04:48.621
But nobody woke me up!

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:49.873
You're so mean!

00:04:49.873 --> 00:04:53.877
Sorry. We didn't notice until we were
checking to see if we forgot anything.

00:04:56.254 --> 00:04:58.798
Wow!

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.219
It's amazing as ever.

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:06.723
A piano!

00:05:07.515 --> 00:05:09.517
Those things you see in rich people's houses!

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.227
And a fireplace!

00:05:11.227 --> 00:05:12.896
This is amazing!

00:05:12.896 --> 00:05:14.814
I've never seen a fireplace before!

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:18.234
- It is amazing, huh? We can light a fire in—
- No, we won't.

00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:21.696
It's not that cold yet.

00:05:21.696 --> 00:05:25.199
Besides... Papa says that if you get
the chimney dirty before winter,

00:05:25.199 --> 00:05:28.494
it's harder for Santa-san to come down it.

00:05:29.078 --> 00:05:30.496
Papa...?

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:31.748
Santa-san?

00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:33.082
How wonderful.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:34.667
What a kind father.

00:05:35.251 --> 00:05:39.088
I always keep this chimney clean.

00:05:39.088 --> 00:05:42.884
Santa-san's never skipped this place.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:47.680
If you need proof...why don't
you take a look inside?

00:05:54.896 --> 00:05:55.813
You...

00:05:56.814 --> 00:05:58.858
Maki thinks Santa...?

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:00.193
- Nico-chan!
- Don't!

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:01.486
Ow, ow!

00:06:01.486 --> 00:06:02.403
What!?

00:06:02.403 --> 00:06:05.323
Don't! Saying that's a serious crime!

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:08.993
That's right! One word will
change Maki-chan's life!

00:06:08.993 --> 00:06:11.037
But it's Maki...

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.873
- That Maki thinks—
- No!

00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:18.127
We'll start with the fundamentals.

00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:19.295
Okay!

00:06:20.463 --> 00:06:23.216
Let's write a song.

00:06:23.675 --> 00:06:25.843
The second floor is huge, too.

00:06:25.843 --> 00:06:27.011
Really?

00:06:27.011 --> 00:06:28.054
We'll start over here.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.890
Umi, you can write the lyrics in here.

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:34.268
I put dictionaries and poetry
books on the shelves for you.

00:06:35.603 --> 00:06:36.896
Thank you very much.

00:06:37.438 --> 00:06:39.732
Kotori, you can design our costumes in here.

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:42.402
There are some books on
fashion and a sewing machine.

00:06:42.986 --> 00:06:45.029
Thank you. This is amazing.

00:06:45.029 --> 00:06:49.409
I'll come up with a few songs
on the piano downstairs.

00:06:49.867 --> 00:06:51.536
Come to me if you need anything.

00:07:05.174 --> 00:07:07.301
But I can't seem to...

00:07:07.301 --> 00:07:08.761
...Feel at ease.

00:07:16.019 --> 00:07:17.687
We have to make it
through the preliminaries.

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:24.902
This feels great.

00:07:24.902 --> 00:07:28.239
The mountains unleash
so much spiritual power.

00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.158
It's making me sleepy.

00:07:31.492 --> 00:07:32.785
She's asleep!?

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:35.038
Hey, it's only a five-minute break.

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:36.831
I kKnow.

00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:45.089
My wristband!

00:07:45.089 --> 00:07:46.549
It's so cute.

00:07:46.549 --> 00:07:47.800
I know, right?

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.219
Wait! This isn't the time for that!

00:07:50.219 --> 00:07:51.971
Give that back!

00:08:01.731 --> 00:08:04.233
I-I can't reach it...

00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:05.485
Help me!

00:08:10.907 --> 00:08:13.159
I can't reach it...

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.119
I can't go any farther!

00:08:15.119 --> 00:08:17.538
A little...more...

00:08:18.372 --> 00:08:21.292
A little...more...

00:08:22.418 --> 00:08:24.128
Just a bit more...

00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:26.005
Okay!

00:08:26.464 --> 00:08:30.009
Just...a little more...

00:08:30.009 --> 00:08:32.720
I can't do it!

00:08:39.602 --> 00:08:41.687
How long is this slope!?

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:43.689
I can't stop!

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:45.608
Nico-chan!

00:08:46.901 --> 00:08:50.321
Someone stop us!

00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:04.669
No way!

00:09:10.424 --> 00:09:13.261
Sheesh... I'm glad you're all right, but...

00:09:13.261 --> 00:09:15.179
We're sorry.

00:09:15.179 --> 00:09:17.056
Amazing! It's a real fireplace!

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.975
Can't you show some concern?

00:09:18.975 --> 00:09:20.935
We need to be quiet.

00:09:20.935 --> 00:09:23.521
Umi-chan and the others
are working upstairs.

00:09:23.521 --> 00:09:25.314
Oh, that's right.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.778
Where's Maki-chan?

00:09:30.778 --> 00:09:32.572
The tea is ready.

00:09:33.281 --> 00:09:34.740
Here, Nico-chan.

00:09:35.199 --> 00:09:36.325
Thanks.

00:09:36.325 --> 00:09:37.910
Rin-chan, here you go.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:38.953
Thanks.

00:09:40.121 --> 00:09:43.207
I'll bring some tea to
Umi-chan and the others.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.505
It's so quiet.

00:09:49.505 --> 00:09:52.175
Everyone must be really focused.

00:09:54.177 --> 00:09:55.678
Umi-chan...

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:58.014
Huh?

00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:02.518
Please don't look for me...
-Umi

00:10:03.477 --> 00:10:04.896
Kotori-chan!

00:10:04.896 --> 00:10:05.479
Umi-chan is—

00:10:05.479 --> 00:10:07.273
Help

00:10:07.648 --> 00:10:09.942
Th-This is an emergency!

00:10:27.376 --> 00:10:29.503
H-Huh?

00:10:31.214 --> 00:10:32.590
Love Live!

00:10:33.674 --> 00:10:34.842
A slump!?

00:10:35.718 --> 00:10:40.514
In other words, you're feeling
more pressure than before?

00:10:40.514 --> 00:10:41.098
Yes.

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:44.101
We're trying not to let it bother us, but...

00:10:44.101 --> 00:10:48.356
When I think about what we'll do if we
don't make it through the preliminaries...

00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:52.193
Well, nevertheless, I was making progress.

00:10:52.193 --> 00:10:54.528
But your sheet music looks awfully blank.

00:10:54.528 --> 00:10:55.905
Hey! Don't look at those!

00:11:00.409 --> 00:11:04.538
Maybe we shouldn't leave it all up to them.

00:11:04.538 --> 00:11:09.752
You're right. With more responsibility,
they're bound to feel more pressure.

00:11:09.752 --> 00:11:15.091
What if we write a song
while exchanging ideas?

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:18.469
Yeah. All nine of us are here.

00:11:18.469 --> 00:11:19.553
Why don't we do that?

00:11:20.721 --> 00:11:24.558
Fine, then. I guess we'll put music to

00:11:24.558 --> 00:11:28.729
- "Nico-Ni-Nico-chan" and—
- With all nine of us,

00:11:28.729 --> 00:11:30.940
we'll never reach a decision.

00:11:31.315 --> 00:11:32.566
You're right.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:35.361
I know!

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:38.322
Let's break into three groups.

00:11:38.322 --> 00:11:41.325
One group, led by Kotori,
will work on the costumes.

00:11:42.118 --> 00:11:44.328
One group, led by Umi,
will work on the lyrics.

00:11:45.121 --> 00:11:48.874
And one group, led by Maki,
will work on the music.

00:11:48.874 --> 00:11:50.209
That's three groups.

00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:52.670
Okay!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:57.091
All right, now that we have our
groups, let's work on the song!

00:11:57.466 --> 00:11:58.676
Yeah!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:11:59.719
Yeah.

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:08.311
Why do we have to put up tents
when we have a cottage?

00:12:08.311 --> 00:12:11.981
If we don't give each other some space,
there's no point to splitting into three groups.

00:12:12.356 --> 00:12:14.442
There just happened to be
some tents in this cottage, too.

00:12:14.442 --> 00:12:16.861
Can we really write a song like this?

00:12:16.861 --> 00:12:20.156
I'll go back to the piano later.

00:12:22.491 --> 00:12:27.747
Let's go make something to eat,
so that Maki can make some progress.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.680
Honoka-chan.

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:56.984
This feels so good.

00:12:56.984 --> 00:13:00.613
Kotori-chan, are you making any progress?

00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:01.197
Yeah.

00:13:01.572 --> 00:13:05.326
After taking a break,
I came up with some ideas.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:07.828
What are those?

00:13:08.412 --> 00:13:10.456
I thought they looked beautiful.

00:13:11.082 --> 00:13:15.002
They're all the same flower, but each
one has a slightly different color.

00:13:15.002 --> 00:13:17.088
They're all unique.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.383
I hope they'll help us with our next song.

00:13:20.841 --> 00:13:22.760
Thanks, Hanayo-chan.

00:13:28.391 --> 00:13:29.892
I feel...

00:13:29.892 --> 00:13:30.601
Yeah.

00:13:31.102 --> 00:13:33.354
...kind of sleepy.

00:13:33.354 --> 00:13:33.854
Yeah.

00:13:46.742 --> 00:13:48.285
No!

00:13:48.285 --> 00:13:51.205
Rin! You mustn't let go of my hand!

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.082
You'll die!

00:13:53.082 --> 00:13:55.167
No!

00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:58.045
It's been like this all day!

00:13:58.045 --> 00:13:59.922
You don't have enough fight in you!

00:14:02.508 --> 00:14:04.635
The clouds are coming in.

00:14:04.635 --> 00:14:06.679
We won't make it to the peak.

00:14:07.221 --> 00:14:08.222
No way...

00:14:11.225 --> 00:14:13.352
But we came so far.

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:14.520
You're so mean!

00:14:14.979 --> 00:14:18.065
I didn't want to come up here at all!

00:14:18.065 --> 00:14:19.525
We have no choice.

00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:22.236
Today, we'll wait until dawn
for the weather to clear.

00:14:22.236 --> 00:14:23.988
Tomorrow, we'll attack.

00:14:24.697 --> 00:14:26.157
We'll attack the peak!

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:27.783
We're still going!?

00:14:28.159 --> 00:14:29.410
Of course!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.662
What do you think we came here for?

00:14:31.662 --> 00:14:34.665
I thought we came to write lyrics!

00:14:35.124 --> 00:14:36.667
Don't tell me you forgot!

00:14:36.667 --> 00:14:38.919
O-Of course not.

00:14:38.919 --> 00:14:42.131
I thought the satisfaction of
conquering the mountain

00:14:42.131 --> 00:14:45.009
would be a good source of
inspiration for our lyrics.

00:14:45.009 --> 00:14:47.052
Now, now, Umi-chan.

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:50.890
I understand how you feel,
but you should stop right there.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:51.640
But...

00:14:52.683 --> 00:14:56.103
Do you know what's most important
when climbing mountains?

00:14:56.979 --> 00:14:58.772
It's not the courage to keep going.

00:14:59.231 --> 00:15:00.774
It's the courage to give up.

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:02.485
You understand, don't you?

00:15:03.194 --> 00:15:04.320
Nozomi...

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.530
Rin-chan, prepare to descend.

00:15:07.198 --> 00:15:09.158
Let's have ramen for dinner tonight.

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:09.992
Really!?

00:15:10.534 --> 00:15:13.037
There were plenty of edible grasses below.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.080
Umi-chan, come help us.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.332
O-Okay.

00:15:18.167 --> 00:15:22.713
I can't believe Nozomi knows so much...

00:15:22.713 --> 00:15:23.964
She's a mystery.

00:15:29.637 --> 00:15:30.346
Hey.

00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:34.975
If we put out the fire, it'll be pitch black, right?

00:15:34.975 --> 00:15:36.852
What? Would that be bad?

00:15:36.852 --> 00:15:38.521
Are you scared of the dark?

00:15:38.521 --> 00:15:40.147
Of course not...

00:15:40.981 --> 00:15:43.943
Wait. Just wait.

00:15:50.241 --> 00:15:52.952
I had no idea Eli had such a weakness.

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:56.413
I can't believe she's scared
of the dark at her age.

00:16:02.253 --> 00:16:05.923
Sheesh... Put yourself in my shoes.

00:16:05.923 --> 00:16:08.342
I have to compose a song for you third years.

00:16:08.342 --> 00:16:09.009
Huh?

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:11.428
What did you just say?

00:16:11.428 --> 00:16:11.929
What?

00:16:11.929 --> 00:16:14.557
You just said you're doing
it for the third years.

00:16:14.557 --> 00:16:16.016
So, what?

00:16:16.016 --> 00:16:19.186
I thought that might be it.

00:16:19.186 --> 00:16:24.066
You need to write a good song for
the third years, so that they can win.

00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:26.068
I-1 didn't mean...

00:16:27.903 --> 00:16:32.491
No matter what, songs
are always for everyone.

00:16:32.491 --> 00:16:33.367
Wh—!

00:16:34.326 --> 00:16:36.120
Why are you acting so high and mighty?

00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:38.122
I'm the club president.

00:16:38.122 --> 00:16:39.164
It's only natural.

00:16:44.086 --> 00:16:44.962
What is this?

00:16:44.962 --> 00:16:46.171
A roasted potato.

00:16:46.171 --> 00:16:48.340
Who doesn't roast potatoes
over an open fire?

00:16:50.551 --> 00:16:51.969
H-Hot! Hot!

00:17:01.353 --> 00:17:01.895
Here.

00:17:09.528 --> 00:17:12.531
Th-Thanks...

00:17:19.121 --> 00:17:21.457
- Is something wrong?
- You took a bite!

00:17:21.457 --> 00:17:24.960
Now that you've eaten some, make
sure you make me stand out the most!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.503
After all, I'm a third year!

00:17:26.503 --> 00:17:28.172
What? You ruined the moment!

00:17:28.172 --> 00:17:29.882
Ruined what?

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:32.176
You ruined it because you ruined it!

00:17:32.176 --> 00:17:33.093
What did you say?

00:17:33.093 --> 00:17:34.637
Gimme back my potato!

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:42.728
I had no idea there was a bath here.

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:44.563
It feels so good.

00:17:44.563 --> 00:17:46.940
I feel so sleepy.

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:47.691
Again?

00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:51.278
I wonder what everyone else is doing...

00:17:51.278 --> 00:17:52.988
I don't know.

00:17:52.988 --> 00:17:55.783
I haven't finished my part yet.

00:17:55.783 --> 00:17:57.159
You can do it.

00:17:57.159 --> 00:17:58.160
But...

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.746
After all, there are nine of us!

00:18:00.746 --> 00:18:01.413
Honoka-chan!

00:18:01.955 --> 00:18:05.000
If someone stops, someone
else will pull them along.

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:08.879
If someone's tired,
someone else will push them.

00:18:09.421 --> 00:18:14.093
Even though we all get lost
or hesitate sometimes,

00:18:14.718 --> 00:18:16.845
we're still making progress.

00:18:20.182 --> 00:18:22.309
So I'm sure you can do it.

00:18:22.893 --> 00:18:26.230
I'm sure the day of the Love Live
preliminaries will go well.

00:18:28.524 --> 00:18:29.608
Yeah.

00:18:29.608 --> 00:18:30.859
You're right.

00:18:32.069 --> 00:18:33.862
It's so beautiful.

00:18:34.363 --> 00:18:37.449
The stars are always watching us.

00:18:37.449 --> 00:18:41.829
After all, your name means "the starry sky."
You should learn to love the stars.

00:18:41.829 --> 00:18:42.329
Yeah.

00:18:42.746 --> 00:18:44.790
You seem to know a lot
about constellations, too.

00:18:45.374 --> 00:18:47.876
Do you have a favorite one?

00:18:47.876 --> 00:18:52.715
Well, I suppose the
Southern Cross stands out.

00:18:53.215 --> 00:18:55.008
The Southern Cross?

00:18:55.008 --> 00:18:57.511
I saw it with the penguins.

00:18:58.095 --> 00:18:59.638
At the South Pole!?

00:18:59.638 --> 00:19:01.056
Oh, a shooting star!

00:19:01.056 --> 00:19:01.598
What?

00:19:01.598 --> 00:19:02.433
Where? Where?

00:19:03.058 --> 00:19:07.688
Shooting stars heading south
are a symbol of progress.

00:19:07.688 --> 00:19:08.605
Nozomi...

00:19:09.857 --> 00:19:13.485
The most important thing is how you feel.

00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:19.074
I missed the shooting star...

00:19:19.074 --> 00:19:23.370
There was never a
shooting star to begin with.

00:20:01.658 --> 00:20:06.121
Always and at any given moment,
do it for everyone, huh?

00:20:24.681 --> 00:20:25.516
Huh?

00:20:29.353 --> 00:20:31.730
<i>No one's.. here?</i>

00:20:45.285 --> 00:20:46.537
Honoka-chan.

00:20:46.537 --> 00:20:48.914
Rin-chan, Nozomi-chan.

00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:49.706
Girls.

00:20:50.249 --> 00:20:51.333
What happened?

00:20:51.333 --> 00:20:54.253
Kotori-chan and the others
were gone when I woke up.

00:21:09.768 --> 00:21:12.145
Jeez... They're hopeless.

00:21:13.313 --> 00:21:15.691
Shall we let them sleep?

00:21:16.066 --> 00:21:19.945
Yes. But we'll start practicing
as soon as they're up.

00:21:21.822 --> 00:21:23.031
Diligently.

00:21:25.367 --> 00:21:27.035
Stage Outfits

00:21:34.877 --> 00:21:36.336
One, two, three, four...

00:21:36.336 --> 00:21:38.046
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:21:38.046 --> 00:21:39.548
One, two, three, four...

00:21:39.548 --> 00:21:40.424
Five, six, seven...

00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:44.928
It's a concert!

00:21:45.345 --> 00:21:47.306
I'm so excited!

00:21:47.306 --> 00:21:48.932
One, two, three, four...

00:21:48.932 --> 00:21:50.434
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:21:50.434 --> 00:21:51.852
One, two, three, four...

00:21:51.852 --> 00:21:53.395
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:21:53.395 --> 00:21:54.897
One, two, three, four...

00:21:54.897 --> 00:21:56.440
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.900
- One, two, three, four...
- Huh? What?

00:21:57.900 --> 00:21:59.443
- Five, six, seven, eight...
- Nico-chan?

00:21:59.443 --> 00:22:00.903
One, two, three, four...

00:22:00.903 --> 00:22:02.446
- Five, six, seven, eight...
- He got me!

00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:02.654
One—

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:09.036
Let's Give It Our All!
The Power of All 9 Members

00:22:09.036 --> 00:22:10.913
Follow Your Dreams!

00:22:10.913 --> 00:22:15.000
Aim for Victory at Love Live!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:20.797
Ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.797 --> 00:22:26.553
samishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:29.806
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.806 --> 00:22:32.809
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.809 --> 00:22:36.813
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:43.946
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi' Go, go')</i>

00:22:43.946 --> 00:22:51.411
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:59.670
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.509
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.509 --> 00:23:12.557
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.557 --> 00:23:21.608
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:32.536
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.872 --> 00:23:38.875
Next time on Love Live!
"Door of Dreams"
